# Authors

AceUnit was written by Christian Hujer.
The first version of AceUnit was published on SourceForge in 2007.

Wink Saville and Christopher Fuhrman have contributed to the previous version of AceUnit.

Detlef Riekenberg (https://github.com/winspool) has contributed bug reports and pull requests to the new version, mostly regarding C89/C90 support.

Amitai Schleier (https://github.com/schmonz) has contributed patches to make packaging AceUnit for NetBSD and other distributions easier.

Ashish Vaghela (https://github.com/Ashish-CodeJourney) has contributed the website and a lot of documentation improvements.
